  description: "Once the training plan or development roadmap is finalized, we begin implementing it. This includes setting up hands-on cyber labs, building web applications, and developing required features. Our team ensures every task is executed with precision, on time, and within scope."
},
{
  index: 4,
  title: "Optimization",
  description: "After the initial delivery, we continuously refine and optimize your training experience or web solutions. This includes updating course content, improving security modules, enhancing app performance, and analyzing feedback to identify areas for improvement."
},
{
  index: 5,
  title: "Reporting",
